        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo malaika umbi uwangalila umulilo wa pa bulambo, afuma ku bulambo. Uyu malaika aikatisha ishiwi, alabilikisha kuli malaika uukwete icikwakwa icatwa, ati, “Bula icikwakwa cobe icatwa, putulako ifisansangu fyonse ifya myangashi ya pa calo, pantu imyangashi yaciko naipya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.18"
            ]
          }
