        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo malaika atendeka ukuputula ifisansangu fya myangashi ya pano calo. Alonganya ifisansangu, afiposa na mu cakukaminamo umwangashi icikalamba ica bukali bwakwa Lesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
